---
// WhatWeDo.astro
---

<section class="what-we-do" id="what-we-do">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content">
      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">Bespoke services are designed to elevate your brand.</p>
      
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M12 2L13.09 8.26L20 9L13.09 9.74L12 16L10.91 9.74L4 9L10.91 8.26L12 2Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Brand Strategy</h3>
          <p>Developing a tailored roadmap that defines your brand's voice, vision, and positioning in the luxury market.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Visual Identity</h3>
          <p>Creating iconic logos, color palettes, and design elements that embody your brand's unique character.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
              <polyline points="14,2 14,8 20,8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
              <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
              <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
              <polyline points="10,9 9,9 8,9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Brand Messaging</h3>
          <p>Crafting compelling messaging that resonates with discerning clients and strengthens brand loyalty.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .what-we-do {
    padding: 60px 0; /* Reduced from 120px */
    background-color: #faf9f7;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    transform: translateZ(0); 
    isolation: isolate; 
    backface-visibility: hidden;
    -webkit-backface-visibility: hidden;
    will-change: auto;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  .content {
    text-align: center;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: #666;
    margin: 0 0 60px 0; /* Reduced from 80px */
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .services-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 60px;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .service-card {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .service-icon {
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    background-color: #a68b5b;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 0 auto 32px auto;
    color: white;
  }

  .service-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
  }

  .service-card p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #666;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Responsive design */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .what-we-do {
      padding: 80px 0;
    }

    .container {
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }

    .services-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
    }

    .service-icon {
      width: 64px;
      height: 64px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
    
    .subtitle {
      margin-bottom: 60px;
    }
  }
</style>